00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:04.130 line:92%
Let's get to some news, guys

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.399 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tomorrow is
an absolutely historic day

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:07.600 size:81% position:41% line:92%
